{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118253","id":3494263846,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7QRjwm","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118253","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118253.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118253.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118253","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118253/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118253/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118253/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/88258729cac6116231d7a5bd07c6832e732b745b","number":118253,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add Virtual Mouse to Android Editor","user":{"login":"Amn4583","id":226307329,"node_id":"U_kgDODX0tAQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226307329?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amn4583","html_url":"https://github.com/Amn4583","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amn4583/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amn4583/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amn4583/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amn4583/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amn4583/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amn4583/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amn4583/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amn4583/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amn4583/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR introduces a new touch control for the **Android editor** called `VirtualMouse`. It aims to address several issues in the Android editor, such as:\r\n- Fingers obstructing the UI while tapping\r\n- Difficulty modifying nodes with small gizmo handles\r\n- Challenges when resizing control nodes\r\n- Issues with drag-and-drop functionality\r\n\r\nThe `VirtualMouse` is designed to enhance usability and provide a smoother experience for touch-based interactions in the editor. This new `VirtualMouse` works like a laptop trackpad allowing precise control without obscuring the target. This is also beneficial for the larger screen devices like tablets.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0edd6c6e-7972-4942-9697-3ffef1fb9b63\r\n\r\n**Gestures:**\r\n- **Single finger drag:** Move cursor \r\n- **Single finger tap:** Left click\r\n- **Single finger double tap:** Double click \r\n- **Two fingers tap simultaneously:** Right click\r\n- **Secondary finger held + primary finger drag:** Drag and drop\r\n- **Two fingers drag in same direction:** Scroll (up/down/left/right)\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c73edd23-18b0-45b3-bb9a-207d86c99af9\r\n\r\nThe system is toggleable via `Editor Settings > Interface > Touchscreen > Enable Virtual Mouse` with an adjustable sensitivity setting. It doesn't interfere while running the games because it only works in the editor.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/96b516ab-b463-42fb-a5e3-3cf2c3455d56\r\n\r\n**Important Note:** It is very important to disable Long Press as Right Click and Pan and Scale Gestures to avoid any gesture conflicts.\r\n\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14613","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-04-06T17:59:20Z","updated_at":"2026-04-11T16:17:51Z","closed_at":"2026-04-06T21:47:23Z","merged_at"